<title>HONG KONG: S'hai Hai Xing 1996 loss at RMB 157.5 mln.</title>
<headline>S'hai Hai Xing 1996 loss at RMB 157.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		   0.0635 loss vs 0.0152 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)	    nil	   vs 0.04</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  102.77 gain vs 174.91 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    157.47 loss vs 37.65 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     3,219.16    vs 3,009.31</p>
<p>    Company name		 Shanghai Hai Xing Shipping Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 7 to June 5</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Shanghai Hai Xing is a Chinese shipping company.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of vessels during the year.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs 0.04 yuan.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
